  "result": "I made all three digest fixes, but I haven't run the test suite or a type check.\n\n- **Opt-in:** `listDigestSubscribers` in `notification-preference-repository.ts` now only returns users with at least one `digestOnly` preference in the workspace. Before, it returned anyone with any preference row.\n- **Most recent updates:** `listUnreadSince` in `notification-repository.ts` now sorts newest first (ties broken by id). `buildDigest` applies the cap after that sort, so it keeps the most recent updates and the headline is the newest one. I also removed the `asc` import, which was no longer used.\n- **Archived workspaces:** `runDigestEmailJob` in `digest-email-job.ts` skips any workspace with `archivedAt` set, and `buildDigest` returns `null` for one, so no digest goes out either way.",
